Gimbal Local licence map
========================

No single licence covers this repository. The applicable terms are determined by
path and by each file's SPDX identifier.

- Upstream-derived files: Apache-2.0 and/or BSD-3-Clause, preserving the
  existing per-file SPDX identifiers and upstream notices.
- `hypervisor/src/hvf/`: Apache-2.0. The Apple Hypervisor.framework backend is
  deliberately contributed back on normal open-source terms.
- `chm/`: FSL-1.1-ALv2. This is source available: reading, auditing, modifying,
  patching, self-hosting, internal use, non-commercial use, and non-competing
  redistribution are permitted. Competing commercial use is restricted. Each
  release automatically converts to Apache-2.0 two years after it is made
  available.
- `app/GimbalLocal/`: LicenseRef-Gimbal-Proprietary. The app source is
  proprietary to Ben De St Paer-Gotch trading as Gimbal. Third-party
  open-source and source-available rights are preserved. A narrow
  PREVIEW/EVALUATION EULA for packaged releases is drafted at
  `app/GimbalLocal/EULA.md`; it is marked for legal review and is not final or
  legal-approved. Repository licences continue to govern source code, and the
  applicable third-party terms control their components.
- Documentation: CC-BY-4.0 unless otherwise marked in `.reuse/dep5`.

Licence texts live in `LICENSES/`, `LICENSE-APACHE`, and
`LICENSE-BSD-3-Clause`. Attribution and third-party notices live in
`CREDITS.md`, `NOTICE`, and `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`.

This repository is opening, not closing: no outside contributor's work is being
relicensed out from under them.
